Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.08,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}嘿 Miku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.24,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你想干嘛 Len？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.21,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我能用你电脑玩Megamix吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:08.09,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你为什么不拿自己Switch玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:09.69,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}因为你电脑上有mod
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.37,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Switch上又弄不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:15.26,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:15.62,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.91,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你要是弄坏我电脑，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.91,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我和Teto就把你Switch砸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:20.02,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你来真的...？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.33,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我警告你 Len
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:23.22,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好好好，我保证不会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:36.42,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.93,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}这破游戏烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:38.38,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:39.78,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}卧槽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:40.36,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}电脑!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:41.78,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}坏了...！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.76,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}要是Miku发现我弄坏了她电脑，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:44.76,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我就死定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:48.04,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}得赶在Miku看到之前把电脑藏起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.01,0:00:51.20,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Len
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:52.29,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我电脑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:53.01,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:53.76,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}什么什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:54.87,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}不就在你房间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.28,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}别给我扯淡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:56.89,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}到底在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:57.45,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}呃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:58.01,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:59.24,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}LEN 我没跟你开玩笑！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:00:59.94,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}到底在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.30,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好好好 我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:04.74,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我被一个谱面气炸了，就把手柄砸向电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:06.88,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我到底为什么还放心把东西交给你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:08.83,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你在Rin的笔记本里装过病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:10.96,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}现在你又把我电脑给砸了！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:12.34,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}对不起嘛...？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.90,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}TETO！去把锤子拿来！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.44,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}别 MIKU 求你别砸啊！！！
